// onsa.toml
// [test]
// mode = "test"
// spec = ["§2.5", "§7"]

// Blocks: `if` / `else`, `match` arms with blocks, and `for` bodies nested 50, 40 and 40 levels.
// Each level is an expression and a block, so two or three tree levels each; the totals stay under
// 256 by any reasonable count. Every `for` runs once (a range of one element).

